参考写法基于支持对应 SQL 的 MySQL 兼容实例。部分分布式 TDSQL 限制 INSERT ... SELECT、索引 HINT 或 DELETE LIMIT，实际版本应分别确认。

CREATE TABLE orders (
  order_id BIGINT NOT NULL PRIMARY KEY,
  customer_name VARCHAR(120) NOT NULL,
  order_date DATE NOT NULL,
  total_amount DECIMAL(12,2),
  KEY idx_order_date (order_date)
) ENGINE=InnoDB DEFAULT CHARSET=utf8mb4;

INSERT INTO orders (order_id, customer_name, order_date, total_amount)
SELECT order_id, customer_name, order_date, total_amount
FROM orders_bak ORDER BY total_amount DESC, order_id LIMIT 100;

UPDATE orders FORCE INDEX (idx_order_date)
SET total_amount = total_amount * 1.10
WHERE order_date = '2022-01-01';

SELECT customer_name, COUNT(*) AS order_count, SUM(total_amount) AS total
FROM orders GROUP BY customer_name HAVING SUM(total_amount) >= 100;

TRUNCATE TABLE orders;

分批伪代码：按主键有序选择最多 1000 个目标 ID；用 DELETE ... WHERE order_id IN (...) 删除这一批；提交；记录游标并视负载节流；下一批重复。遇死锁只重试当前批。循环前确定待删除的数据边界，避免把并发新增数据纳入清理。

TRUNCATE 避免逐行删除产生的日志量，但并不能保证完全不写 redo 或 binlog，且通常隐式提交。实际执行前需确认目标和可恢复方案。

